{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108122","id":2627200186,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6cl-S6","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108122","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108122.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108122.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108122","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108122/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108122/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108122/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b400633dc28e539f2f7d05f47249e0205bf2f81b","number":108122,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Properly show detach script button when script is added via inspector","user":{"login":"Kazuo256","id":645222,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTIyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/645222?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256","html_url":"https://github.com/Kazuo256","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #107059.\r\n\r\nThe SceneTreeDock was not tracking script changes in selected nodes in any capacity as far as I could assess. To do\r\nthat, my solution essentially connects the \"script_changed\" signal from selected nodes to\r\n`SceneTreeDock::_update_script_button()` whenever the selection changes. It actually queues the update to make sure it\r\nhappens only once no matter how many nodes are selected.\r\n    \r\nHowever, only connecting that signal would leave previously selected nodes with a signal connection that should no\r\nlonger exist. To properly disconnect previously selected nodes, we have to store the list of currently selected nodes so\r\nwe can disconnect them when the selection changes.\r\n\r\nThe PR also replaces all uses of `SceneTreeDock::_update_script_button()` with the queued alternative, besides other minor minor improvements requested in the review. See commit message for more details.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","tit